  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Sajjan Jindal (born 5 December 1959) is an Indian billionaire businessman. He is the chairman and managing director of JSW Group.\nFor 2021–22, he was the chairman of World Steel Association. He was replaced by POSCO's Jeong-Woo Choi.\n\n",
